<li data-start=3D"3646" data-end=3D"3708" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3649" data-end=3D"3708" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
649" data-end=3D"3663">CSS / SCSS</strong> : Le fichier de styles sp=C3=A9c=
ifique =C3=A0 la page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3709" data-end=3D"3833" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3712" data-end=3D"3833" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
712" data-end=3D"3733">Module de la page</strong> : Un module Angular qui e=
ncapsule les d=C3=A9pendances de la page, notamment ses composants et servi=
ces.</p>
</li>
</ol>
