<li data-start=3D"1030" data-end=3D"1121" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1032" data-end=3D"1121" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
032" data-end=3D"1057">Formatage des donn=C3=A9es</strong> : Par exemple, f=
