</li>
<li data-start=3D"1122" data-end=3D"1220" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1124" data-end=3D"1220" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
124" data-end=3D"1147">Filtrage des listes</strong> : Par exemple, filtrer =
une liste d'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments selon un crit=C3=A8re sp=C3=A9cifique.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1221" data-end=3D"1321" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1223" data-end=3D"1321" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
223" data-end=3D"1256">Transformation conditionnelle</strong> : Appliquer d=
