<ol data-start=3D"7569" data-end=3D"8756">
<li data-start=3D"7569" data-end=3D"7798" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7572" data-end=3D"7798" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
572" data-end=3D"7596">Organisation logique</strong> : Assurez-vous de bien=
 organiser les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments partag=C3=A9s en sous-dossiers logiques (=
