<h3 data-start=3D"3165" data-end=3D"3222" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3169" data-end=3D"3222">3. Acc=C3=A9der aux Fichiers dans le Dossier <code =
data-start=3D"3211" data-end=3D"3220">assets/</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3224" data-end=3D"3494" class=3D"">Les fichiers dans le do=
