<p data-start=3D"6804" data-end=3D"6822" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
804" data-end=3D"6820">Explications</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6824" data-end=3D"7244">
<li data-start=3D"6824" data-end=3D"7104" class=3D"">
